%% Component diagram: person and identity modules inside the Docket API.
flowchart LR
  Creation[Person creation] --> Actors[Actor persistence]
  Invitation[Invitation acceptance] --> Actors
  Import[Integration ingestion] --> Attribution[Source attribution]
  Resolution[Identity resolution] --> Actors
  Resolution --> Attribution
  Consolidation[Person consolidation] --> Actors
  Consolidation --> Attribution
  Consolidation --> Aliases[Actor alias resolution]
  Readers[Profile, search, and mention readers] --> Actors
  Readers --> Aliases
